[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.86,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Welcome back to \"Trails by the Experts.\"",
    "char_start": 16,
    "char_end": 56,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1.92,
    "end": 8.94,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Today, we're talking about trail construction, and I'm joined by Marco Bellini, a trail builder with the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 57,
    "char_end": 180,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 9.0,
    "end": 11.16,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Marco Bellini, thank you for being here.",
    "char_start": 181,
    "char_end": 221,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 11.16,
    "end": 12.06,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
    "char_start": 237,
    "char_end": 255,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.12,
    "end": 17.22,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "It's my pleasure – building trails is something I've given a lot of thought to.",
    "char_start": 256,
    "char_end": 335,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.22,
    "end": 19.74,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "This episode is sponsored by Strava.",
    "char_start": 352,
    "char_end": 388,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 19.8,
    "end": 21.6,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
    "char_start": 389,
    "char_end": 420,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.66,
    "end": 23.4,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Start at strava.com/podcast.",
    "char_start": 421,
    "char_end": 449,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.0,
    "end": 212.34,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made that decision.",
    "char_start": 450,
    "char_end": 491,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 212.4,
    "end": 215.04,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 492,
    "char_end": 532,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s05"
  },
  {
    "start": 215.04,
    "end": 220.56,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Honestly, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 548,
    "char_end": 631,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 220.62,
    "end": 224.04,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 632,
    "char_end": 688,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 224.1,
    "end": 227.46,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 689,
    "char_end": 751,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 227.46,
    "end": 229.8,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
    "char_start": 768,
    "char_end": 806,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 229.86,
    "end": 232.92,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
    "char_start": 807,
    "char_end": 856,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 232.92,
    "end": 239.28,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Yes, see – the most common mistake that beginner builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
    "char_start": 872,
    "char_end": 977,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 239.34,
    "end": 243.96,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 978,
    "char_end": 1044,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.96,
    "end": 245.16,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into this.",
    "char_start": 1061,
    "char_end": 1094,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.22,
    "end": 249.36,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1095,
    "char_end": 1150,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 249.36,
    "end": 249.72,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1166,
    "char_end": 1176,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 249.78,
    "end": 254.88,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Discussions about land management should take place before any excavation begins.",
    "char_start": 1177,
    "char_end": 1258,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 254.94,
    "end": 257.7,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen it on teams that use RockShox.",
    "char_start": 1259,
    "char_end": 1300,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 257.76,
    "end": 261.48,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "The frame is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
    "char_start": 1301,
    "char_end": 1376,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 261.48,
    "end": 262.98,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me more.",
    "char_start": 1393,
    "char_end": 1406,
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 262.98,
    "end": 272.52,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within their workflow, the benefits become apparent – if you ignore them, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 1422,
    "char_end": 1598,
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.52,
    "end": 274.86,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 1615,
    "char_end": 1649,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 274.92,
    "end": 279.06,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1650,
    "char_end": 1705,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.06,
    "end": 279.42,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1721,
    "char_end": 1731,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.48,
    "end": 282.72,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Cutting switchbacks into slopes is not optional.",
    "char_start": 1732,
    "char_end": 1780,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.78,
    "end": 286.26,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "The shortcut of the first day becomes the landslide of the third year.",
    "char_start": 1781,
    "char_end": 1851,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 286.32,
    "end": 290.4,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 1852,
    "char_end": 1923,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 290.4,
    "end": 291.48,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "It's a helpful framework.",
    "char_start": 1940,
    "char_end": 1965,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 291.54,
    "end": 294.6,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the most important aspect of this question?",
    "char_start": 1966,
    "char_end": 2017,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 294.6,
    "end": 298.86,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Yes, look – the structure of the soil matters more than people realize.",
    "char_start": 2033,
    "char_end": 2104,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 298.92,
    "end": 302.04,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 2105,
    "char_end": 2154,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 302.1,
    "end": 305.46,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2155,
    "char_end": 2217,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 305.46,
    "end": 307.26,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the nature of the malfunction?",
    "char_start": 2234,
    "char_end": 2272,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.32,
    "end": 312.36,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the underlying structural aspect that most listeners are not aware of?",
    "char_start": 2273,
    "char_end": 2351,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 312.36,
    "end": 315.42,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Let me give you my honest opinion.",
    "char_start": 2367,
    "char_end": 2401,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 315.48,
    "end": 320.16,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've changed my mind about machine-made trails versus hand-crafted trails.",
    "char_start": 2402,
    "char_end": 2476,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 320.22,
    "end": 323.58,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2477,
    "char_end": 2539,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 323.58,
    "end": 325.08,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me more.",
    "char_start": 2556,
    "char_end": 2569,
    "unit_id": "t0016.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0016.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 325.08,
    "end": 334.92,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "And when teams adopt the Cascadia Alliance in that process, the trade-off becomes apparent – if you ignore it, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 2585,
    "char_end": 2762,
    "unit_id": "t0017.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0017.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 334.92,
    "end": 338.04,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
    "char_start": 2779,
    "char_end": 2830,
    "unit_id": "t0018.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0018.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 720.0,
    "end": 722.7,
