  },
  {
    "start": 840.0,
    "end": 841.74,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Welcome back to the show.",
    "char_start": 3035,
    "char_end": 3060,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 841.8,
    "end": 843.6,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "How does the fault mechanism work?",
    "char_start": 3061,
    "char_end": 3095,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 843.66,
    "end": 847.8,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 3096,
    "char_end": 3151,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 847.8,
    "end": 848.76,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "That's how I see it.",
    "char_start": 3167,
    "char_end": 3187,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 848.82,
    "end": 853.5,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 3188,
    "char_end": 3261,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 853.56,
    "end": 856.26,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen it in teams that use Shimano components.",
    "char_start": 3262,
    "char_end": 3313,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 856.32,
    "end": 860.22,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 3314,
    "char_end": 3401,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 860.22,
    "end": 862.56,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
    "char_start": 3418,
    "char_end": 3456,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 862.62,
    "end": 865.26,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 3457,
    "char_end": 3497,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 865.26,
    "end": 871.62,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Yes, see – the most common mistake that novice builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
    "char_start": 3513,
    "char_end": 3616,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 871.68,
    "end": 876.3,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 3617,
    "char_end": 3683,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 876.3,
    "end": 879.54,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Challenge my conventional wisdom.",
    "char_start": 3700,
    "char_end": 3733,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 879.6,
    "end": 882.36,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What were your previous beliefs on this topic, and how have they changed?",
    "char_start": 3734,
    "char_end": 3807,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 882.36,
    "end": 885.42,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Let me give you my honest opinion.",
    "char_start": 3823,
    "char_end": 3857,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 885.48,
    "end": 890.58,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Discussions about land management should take place before any excavation begins.",
    "char_start": 3858,
    "char_end": 3939,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 890.64,
    "end": 893.76,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen teams using Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 3940,
    "char_end": 3978,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 893.82,
    "end": 897.18,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 3979,
    "char_end": 4041,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 897.18,
    "end": 898.68,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Quadra.",
    "char_start": 4058,
    "char_end": 4065,
    "unit_id": "t0026.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0026.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 898.68,
    "end": 905.1,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Outside of the tools provided by the Cascadia Alliance framework, identifying the root cause of the problem can be more challenging.",
    "char_start": 4081,
    "char_end": 4213,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 905.16,
    "end": 909.24,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "And the second-order effects are the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 4214,
    "char_end": 4287,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 909.24,
    "end": 911.52,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
    "char_start": 4304,
    "char_end": 4362,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 911.58,
    "end": 914.64,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the most important aspect of this question?",
    "char_start": 4363,
    "char_end": 4414,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 914.64,
    "end": 919.08,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "It boils down to this: cutting corners on slopes is not optional.",
    "char_start": 4430,
    "char_end": 4495,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 919.14,
    "end": 922.62,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "The shortcut on the first day leads to the landslide on the third year.",
    "char_start": 4496,
    "char_end": 4567,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 922.68,
    "end": 926.04,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4568,
    "char_end": 4630,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1320.0,
    "end": 1321.8,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the typical process for dealing with a malfunction?",
    "char_start": 4647,
    "char_end": 4706,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1321.86,
    "end": 1325.76,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the most often overlooked aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 4707,
    "char_end": 4770,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1325.76,
    "end": 1328.82,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Let me give you my honest opinion.",
    "char_start": 4786,
    "char_end": 4820,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1328.88,
    "end": 1332.36,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Soil structure is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 4821,
    "char_end": 4874,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1332.42,
    "end": 1335.84,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 4875,
    "char_end": 4931,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1335.9,
    "end": 1339.26,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4932,
    "char_end": 4994,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 1339.26,
    "end": 1340.46,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into this.",
    "char_start": 5011,
    "char_end": 5044,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1340.52,
    "end": 1343.1,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "How does Shimano fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 5045,
    "char_end": 5084,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1343.1,
    "end": 1348.56,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Yes, look – I've changed my mind about machine-made trails versus hand-made trails.",
    "char_start": 5100,
    "char_end": 5183,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1348.62,
    "end": 1353.24,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5184,
    "char_end": 5250,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1353.24,
    "end": 1354.8,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "char_start": 5267,
    "char_end": 5294,
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1354.8,
    "end": 1360.56,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Outside of the diagnostic tools provided by RockShox, it can be more difficult to identify the cause of the problem.",
    "char_start": 5310,
    "char_end": 5426,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1360.62,
    "end": 1365.24,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the troubleshooting process becomes easier.",
    "char_start": 5427,
    "char_end": 5508,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1365.24,
    "end": 1370.16,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final part to the management of the territory.",
    "char_start": 5525,
    "char_end": 5621,
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1370.16,
    "end": 1379.16,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "That's where the conversation becomes truly interesting, because the compromises involved in managing the territory touch upon everything we've discussed.",
    "char_start": 5637,
    "char_end": 5791,
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1379.16,
    "end": 1380.36,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper.",
    "char_start": 5808,
    "char_end": 5831,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1380.42,
    "end": 1385.34,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "char_start": 5832,
    "char_end": 5904,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1385.34,
    "end": 1391.22,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "It boils down to this: drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 5920,
    "char_end": 6016,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1391.28,
    "end": 1394.04,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen it happen with teams using RockShox products.",
    "char_start": 6017,
    "char_end": 6073,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1394.1,
    "end": 1398.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 6074,
    "char_end": 6161,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1398.0,
    "end": 1399.8,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the typical process for dealing with a malfunction?",
    "char_start": 6178,
    "char_end": 6237,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1399.86,
    "end": 1403.76,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the most often overlooked aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 6238,
    "char_end": 6301,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1403.76,
    "end": 1410.18,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that novice builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
    "char_start": 6317,
    "char_end": 6419,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1410.24,
    "end": 1413.96,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "The overall picture is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
    "char_start": 6420,
    "char_end": 6506,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1680.0,
    "end": 1685.28,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
    "char_start": 6523,
    "char_end": 6591,
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1685.28,
    "end": 1689.6,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "char_start": 6607,
    "char_end": 6675,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1689.66,
    "end": 1690.98,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "char_start": 6676,
    "char_end": 6705,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1690.98,
    "end": 1695.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "char_start": 6722,
    "char_end": 6777,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1695.06,
    "end": 1699.74,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "char_start": 6778,
    "char_end": 6853,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1699.8,
    "end": 1701.6,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
    "char_start": 6854,
    "char_end": 6881,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1701.6,
    "end": 1704.18,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Marco Bellini, thank you for the conversation.",
    "char_start": 6882,
    "char_end": 6928,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 1704.18,
    "end": 1705.68,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
    "char_start": 6944,
    "char_end": 6962,
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1705.68,
    "end": 1708.8,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "That's all for today's episode of \"Author's Trails.\"",
    "char_start": 6979,
    "char_end": 7031,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1708.86,
    "end": 1710.6,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "See you next time.",
    "char_start": 7032,
    "char_end": 7050,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02"
  }
]
